---
---

<section id="projects" class="py-24 relative">
	<div class="reveal mb-12 flex items-center gap-4">
		<h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white">
			<span class="text-emerald-400 font-mono text-xl mr-2">04.</span> Projects
		</h2>
		<div class="h-px bg-zinc-800 flex-grow max-w-xs"></div>
	</div>

	<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 reveal">
		<!-- Project 1 -->
		<div class="glass-card rounded-xl p-8 group relative overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 flex flex-col h-full">
			<div class="mb-4 flex justify-between items-center relative z-20">
				<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">
					Bank Bangladesh
				</h3>
				<span class="px-2 py-1 bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-mono rounded border border-emerald-500/20">
					Overseas Client
				</span>
			</div>
			<div class="relative z-20 flex flex-col flex-grow">
				<p class="text-zinc-400 text-sm mb-6 leading-relaxed">
					Managed the Lakupandai channel, customized to meet local population needs. Overcame challenges in different business flows and habits, successfully deploying an international middleware solution.
				</p>
				<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-auto">
					<span class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-300 px-2 py-1 bg-zinc-800/50 rounded">Golang</span>
					<span class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-300 px-2 py-1 bg-zinc-800/50 rounded">Lakupandai</span>
					<span class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-300 px-2 py-1 bg-zinc-800/50 rounded">Custom Switch</span>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>

		<!-- Project 2 -->
		<div class="glass-card rounded-xl p-8 group relative overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 flex flex-col h-full">
			<div class="mb-4 flex justify-between items-center relative z-20">
				<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">
					mGate v2 Middleware
				</h3>
				<span class="px-2 py-1 bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-mono rounded border border-emerald-500/20">
					Core Product
				</span>
			</div>
			<div class="relative z-20 flex flex-col flex-grow">
				<p class="text-zinc-400 text-sm mb-6 leading-relaxed">
					Development and enhancement of the core microservices middleware. Built robust ETL processes (DataJoiner, JSONMerger) and integrated high-performance messaging utilizing NATS and Kubernetes.
				</p>
				<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-auto">
					<span class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-300 px-2 py-1 bg-zinc-800/50 rounded">Go Micro</span>
					<span class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-300 px-2 py-1 bg-zinc-800/50 rounded">NATS</span>
					<span class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-300 px-2 py-1 bg-zinc-800/50 rounded">K8s</span>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>

		<!-- Project 3 -->
		<div class="glass-card rounded-xl p-8 group relative overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 flex flex-col h-full">
			<div class="mb-4 flex justify-between items-center relative z-20">
				<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">
					Bank SBI Indonesia
				</h3>
				<span class="px-2 py-1 bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-mono rounded border border-emerald-500/20">
					Enterprise
				</span>
			</div>
			<div class="relative z-20 flex flex-col flex-grow">
				<p class="text-zinc-400 text-sm mb-6 leading-relaxed">
					Managed transactions from almost every channel including Mobile Banking, Internet Banking, Business Banking, Teller, and Core Banking ensuring seamless flow and alignment with standard policies.
				</p>
				<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-auto">
					<span class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-300 px-2 py-1 bg-zinc-800/50 rounded">Omnichannel</span>
					<span class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-300 px-2 py-1 bg-zinc-800/50 rounded">Core Banking</span>
					<span class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-300 px-2 py-1 bg-zinc-800/50 rounded">Java/Go</span>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>

		<!-- Project 4 -->
		<div class="glass-card rounded-xl p-8 group relative overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 flex flex-col h-full">
			<div class="mb-4 flex justify-between items-center relative z-20">
				<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">
					Bank Artha Graha
				</h3>
				<span class="px-2 py-1 bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-mono rounded border border-emerald-500/20">
					Enterprise
				</span>
			</div>
			<div class="relative z-20 flex flex-col flex-grow">
				<p class="text-zinc-400 text-sm mb-6 leading-relaxed">
					Played a vital role in routing transactions across various platforms using Fiorano middleware, maintaining high precision in integrations between core systems and third-party endpoints.
				</p>
				<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-auto">
					<span class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-300 px-2 py-1 bg-zinc-800/50 rounded">Fiorano</span>
					<span class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-300 px-2 py-1 bg-zinc-800/50 rounded">Transaction Routing</span>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>

		<!-- Project 5 -->
		<div class="glass-card rounded-xl p-8 group relative overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 flex flex-col h-full">
			<div class="mb-4 flex justify-between items-center relative z-20">
				<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">
					Bank J-Trust (BI-FAST)
				</h3>
				<span class="px-2 py-1 bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-mono rounded border border-emerald-500/20">
					Real-time
				</span>
			</div>
			<div class="relative z-20 flex flex-col flex-grow">
				<p class="text-zinc-400 text-sm mb-6 leading-relaxed">
					Developed and integrated the BI-FAST feature for e-Channels, enabling real-time secure money transfers adhering to central bank standards and low-latency requirements.
				</p>
				<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-auto">
					<span class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-300 px-2 py-1 bg-zinc-800/50 rounded">BI-FAST</span>
					<span class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-300 px-2 py-1 bg-zinc-800/50 rounded">e-Channel</span>
					<span class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-300 px-2 py-1 bg-zinc-800/50 rounded">ISO 8583</span>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
